    "detailed_description": "<h1>Update Notes</h1><p>Viersion 1.2:\r\n\u30fbEnglish Localization added to the Full game\r\n\u30fbPlayable Demo now available in 11 languages: Japanese, English French, German, Brazilian Portuguese, Latin American Spanish, Korean, Thai, Chinese (Simplified), Chinese (Traditional)\r\n\u30fbEasy Mode: Enemy attack damage is halved, Instant death traps in dungeons deal less damage\r\n\u30fbCinematic mode: Graphical updates added to allow for better viewing experience (available on all platforms)</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Arise! The time for sleep has passed. The world needs you now, more than ever, as the threat of destruction looms closer with each passing moment.\r\n\r\nThe path of salvation lies ahead with only one way to attain it. You must conquer the dungeon and its keeper that awaits you.\r\nBeware not to outstay your welcome as your life energy is slowly drained the longer you stay in the dungeon.\r\n\r\nThose brave enough to venture the dungeon are rewarded with items to help power up their equipment, allowing them to reach further into its depths.\r\n\r\nComplete quests, fight bosses, collect items and fish like your life depends on it!\r\n\r\nMastering this chaotic world will prove difficult as it transforms with each passing life.\r\nWill you answer the call to save the world?",
    "about_the_game": "Arise! The time for sleep has passed. The world needs you now, more than ever, as the threat of destruction looms closer with each passing moment.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe path of salvation lies ahead with only one way to attain it. You must conquer the dungeon and its keeper that awaits you.<br />\r\nBeware not to outstay your welcome as your life energy is slowly drained the longer you stay in the dungeon.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThose brave enough to venture the dungeon are rewarded with items to help power up their equipment, allowing them to reach further into its depths.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nComplete quests, fight bosses, collect items and fish like your life depends on it!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMastering this chaotic world will prove difficult as it transforms with each passing life.<br />\r\nWill you answer the call to save the world?",
    "short_description": "Steel yourself in the face of insurmountable opposition as you traverse this ever-changing world in a bid to save it from imminent desolation.",
    "supported_languages": "English, Polish, Japanese, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese",
